    "summary": "Use it in either player's Fight phase, right after an enemy unit selects its targets. Pick 1 of your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units it targeted. Until the phase ends, whenever a model of that unit is **destroyed** before it has fought this phase, roll a D6, adding 1 if the unit is **ENTRENCHED**. If the result is 4+, that model:\n\n1. stays in play\n2. may fight, but only after the attacking unit is done attacking\n3. is removed afterwards",
